    comp_baseline.rou.xml
    =====================
    COMPOSITION: Baseline (matches original config/traffic.rou.xml exactly)
      car_standard:    40%
      bus_city:        15%
      truck_light:     15%
      delivery_van:    10%
      vehicle_general: 10%
      coach_long:      10%

    This file is used by run_composition_experiment.py to verify that
    comp_baseline results match the existing data/ results.
    The vehsPerHour values below are for 568 veh/hr total (LOS-A reference).
    run_composition_experiment.py will pass a scaled route file from
    data/capacity_analysis/volumes/ instead — this file defines vehicle
    type distributions only and is used as the TYPE REFERENCE.
    Actual flows are scaled via Pipeline A route files.
-->
